  <sharedSelectionEntries>
    <selectionEntry name="Battle Traits: Matriarch&apos;s Mob" id="9b6e-e98d-b14e-5993" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink name="Reference" id="7d73-0bf9-4ce8-8e32" hidden="false" primary="true" targetId="3360-1158-e879-9606"/>
      </categoryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="I&apos;ve Heard She Can..." id="78a8-9542-b559-9afa" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects:

***...Shoot Fire From Her Eyes!:*** Inflict D3 mortal damage on each visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of the friendly **Ma Maegran**.

***...Turn You Into a Human!:*** Pick a visible friendly unit wholly within 12&quot; of the friendly **Ma Maegran**. Until the start of your next turn, enemy units have a maximum control score of 1 while they are in combat with that unit.

***...Make Ya Big and Strong!:*** Pick another visible friendly unit wholly within 12&quot; of the friendly **Ma Maegran**. Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of that unit&apos;s weapons for the rest of the turn.

***...Whiz the Biggest Bangers!:*** Add 1 to casting rolls for the friendly **Ma Maegran** until the start of your next turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Oi! Gerroff!" id="5fb5-cbbf-f0f3-ce6b" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If the friendly **Ma Maegran** is in combat and damaged, pick up to 3 friendly **Mancrusher Gargants** on the battlefield that are visible to her to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Each target has **^^Strike-first^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Summon the Herd" id="dfd2-2b72-13f6-ad7f" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If the friendly **Ma Maegran** is on the battlefield, pick each enemy non-**^^Fly^^** non-**^^Monster^^** unit that is visible to her to be the targets.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice for each target equal to the current battle round number. For each 4+, allocate 1 mortal damage to the target (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"/>
            <characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"/>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Don&apos;t Let Nuffin&apos; Happen to Her!" id="aee8-86de-0e5f-2602" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)">
          <attributes>
            <attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute>
            <attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute>
            <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8"/>
          </attributes>
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"/>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While the friendly **Ma Maegran** is within the combat range of another friendly **^^Little^^** unit:
• She has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.
• Each time you make a successful ward roll for her, allocate 1 mortal damage to another friendly **^^Little^^** unit within her combat range after the damage sequence for her has been resolved (ward rolls cannot be made for those damage points).
• Ignore negative modifiers to hit rolls and wound rolls for that other friendly **^^Little^^** unit&apos;s combat attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
  </sharedSelectionEntries>
  <sharedSelectionEntryGroups>
    <selectionEntryGroup name="Marks of the Chooser&apos;s Chosen" id="b1dc-0f99-efdc-28d2" hidden="false">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="6c3c-e059-564b-fdc5" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
        <constraint id="a709-a608-b4c2-8053" field="selections" scope="root-entry" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Marks of the Chooser&apos;s Chosen" id="47d6-334f-a43b-cfa1" hidden="false">
          <rules>
            <rule name="Enhancement Restrictions" id="f624-a491-1842-829c" hidden="true">
              <description>Marks of the Chooser&apos;s Chosen are unique enhancements that can be given to **Mancrusher Gargants**. A unit can only have 1 Mark of the Chooser&apos;s Chosen.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Butt of the Lash" id="83f6-495b-d919-7334" hidden="false" import="true" publicationId="b765-4747-cddc-385e" type="upgrade">
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="635d-9d29-ca50-914e" field="selections" includeChildSelections="true" scope="roster" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile name="Butt of the Lash" id="ff19-9ea8-6a4b-bfbd" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)">
                  <attributes>
                    <attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute>
                    <attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute>
                    <attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa"/>
                  </attributes>
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
